            "review_title": "Review at LAIKEE Mì Gia - Mì Hong Kong Trứ Danh",
            "review_text": "James S\n47 contributions\n0\nBrilliant pork!\nMay 2025 • Solo\nYesterday and today I visited this brilliant Chinese restaurant in Ho Chin Minh. Each time I was cordially greeted by a nice young man, who swiftly offered me a menu and politely asked what I wanted to order. Today I chose to order the Com Cari Tom, which was nicely done prawns with a delicious curry sauce and rice. Alongside this I ordered a Mi suon Chien, which was a pork noodle soup, with vegetables, the pork was absolutely out of this world and the best I have ever tasted! A shame this place does not have more reviews so more people would be aware of it! Thanks\nRead more\nWritten May 3, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
